<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR OPENS AT $58-1/4 IN NEW YORK.</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR OPENS AT $58-1/4 IN NEW YORK.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia Oy's A share</p>
<p>ADR opened up $0-3/4 at $58-1/4 in New York on Friday.</p>
<p>The price corresponds to about 301.57 markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
